<title>UK: Societe Generale sets warrants on 30-year bund.</title>
<headline>Societe Generale sets warrants on 30-year bund.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale said it has issued six million American-style call and put warrants, in two equal tranches, on the 6.50 pct German bund due July 2027.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	20.JUL.98		 PAYDATE	29.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSS, BERLIN   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  101.63 ONE BUND IS CONTROLLED BY 10 WARRANTS (DEM 1000 NOMINAL)* * * * * *</p>
<p>	  TYPE	 STRIKE	   ISSUE</p>
<p>SERIES M CALL	 106		1.62 DEM</p>
<p>SERIES N PUT	  93		 2.02 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
